## Overview

Step into the secret world that wakes up when you go to sleep. **Whiskers & Wildlife** brings you raw, authentic, and cozy stealth trail cam footage from a dedicated community cat and wildlife watch.

By day, our cameras follow the routines of neighborhood feral cats, stray cats, and playful kittens as they navigate the yard. By night, the infrared lenses reveal a completely different shift: masked raccoon families raiding the shelves, nocturnal wildlife exploring the porch, and tense midnight standoffs.

No flashing lights, no heavy voiceovers—just the peaceful, fascinating reality of the secret life of street cats and backyard wildlife.

## Featured Video: Midnight Raids

{% youtube id="2Q6nDnC62g8" title="Who Invited the Masked Bandits" /%}

When the sun sets, the "night shift" clocks in. Watch what happens when a troop of curious masked bandits discovers the porch shelves under infrared night vision.

## The Dual Watch: Day vs. Night Shift

The backyard undergoes a complete transformation between dusk and dawn:

### The Day Shift: Community Cats & Kittens
- **Territory & Routines** — Tracking the regular feeding habits, basking spots, and social dynamics of the neighborhood feral colony.
- **Kitten Antics** — Documenting stray kittens learning to climb, explore, and play safely in the garden.
- **Colony Care & Monitoring** — Ensuring community cats are healthy, fed, and sheltered throughout every season.

### The Night Shift: Nocturnal Explorers
- **Masked Bandits** — Mischievous raccoon families systematically inspecting the porch, testing cabinet latches, and climbing shelves.
- **Nocturnal Visitors** — Opossums, foxes, and other twilight wanderers crossing through on their nightly patrols.
- **Midnight Standoffs** — High-stakes, silent staring contests between curious night critters and resident guard cats.

## Trail Cam Rig & Philosophy

Capturing authentic wildlife behavior requires complete respect for the animals and their natural habitat:

- **True Stealth Infrared (No Glow / Low Glow)** — Utilizing infrared emitters that illuminate in pitch black without blinding visible flashes or disturbing animal sleep cycles.
- **Pure Ambient Sound** — Zero talking heads, loud sound effects, or disruptive background music. Every video preserves the real ambient nighttime acoustics: wind in the trees, cautious footsteps on wood, and the occasional startled chitter.
- **Non-Invasive Observation** — Fixed covert mounting along natural animal thoroughfares to document genuine, undisturbed behavior.

## Follow the Journey

New footage is captured daily across the yard and porch trail cams. 

